    "adapt": "A hostless plot beside the power plant: no building, so the kit never turns. Every row rests on the probed ground (`--terrain`). The coal buyer stands behind a shop counter facing north (his premium buyer, `power_plant`, on its top), three coal heaps and a barrow behind him, a hopper (shaft tippler, metal bin and a rail cart) and a Ural parked along it to the east make the truck bay, two flood lamps light the yard and the pole plate stands west of the counter. Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
